{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"863aa7b1543849e3cfd2c559a4715af74ecbeb9dde4c86853162816b04e9f732","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["猶大百姓的厄運"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對我說：「雖有摩西和撒母耳站在我面前代求，我的心也不顧惜這百姓。你將他們從我眼前趕出，叫他們去吧！"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他們問你說：『我們往哪裏去呢？』你便告訴他們，耶和華如此說：",{"text":"定為死亡的，必致死亡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"定為刀殺的，必交刀殺；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"定為饑荒的，必遭饑荒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"定為擄掠的，必被擄掠。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和華說：「我命定四樣害他們，就是刀劍殺戮、狗類撕裂、空中的飛鳥，和地上的野獸吞吃毀滅；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["又必使他們在天下萬國中拋來拋去，都因猶大王希西家的兒子瑪拿西在耶路撒冷所行的事。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，誰可憐你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰為你悲傷呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰轉身問你的安呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：你棄絕了我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"轉身退後；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我伸手攻擊你，毀壞你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我後悔甚不耐煩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在境內各城門口","poem":1},{"noteId":20},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用簸箕簸了我的百姓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們喪掉兒女。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我毀滅他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們仍不轉離所行的道。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的寡婦在我面前比海沙更多；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使滅命的午間來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻擊少年人的母親，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使痛苦驚嚇忽然臨到她身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"生過七子的婦人力衰氣絕；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尚在白晝，日頭忽落；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她抱愧蒙羞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其餘的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在他們敵人跟前，交與刀劍。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米向耶和華訴苦"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我的母親哪，我有禍了！因你生我作為遍地相爭相競的人。我素來沒有借貸與人，人也沒有借貸與我，人人卻都咒罵我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和華說：「我必要堅固你，使你得好處。災禍苦難臨到的時候，我必要使仇敵央求你。（"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["人豈能將銅與鐵，就是北方的鐵折斷呢？）"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["「我必因你在四境之內所犯的一切罪，把你的貨物財寶當掠物，白白地交給仇敵。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我也必使仇敵帶這掠物到你所不認識的地去，因我怒中起的火要將你們焚燒。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，你是知道的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你記念我，眷顧我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向逼迫我的人為我報仇；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要向他們忍怒取我的命，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要知道我為你的緣故受了凌辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華－萬軍之上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我得着你的言語就當食物吃了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的言語是我心中的歡喜快樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我是稱為你名下的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我沒有坐在宴樂人的會中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有歡樂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因你的感動","poem":1},{"noteId":21},{"text":"獨自靜坐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你使我滿心憤恨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的痛苦為何長久不止呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的傷痕為何無法醫治、不能痊癒呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道你待我有詭詐，像流乾的河道嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"耶和華如此說：你若歸回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就將你再帶來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你站在我面前；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你若將寶貴的和下賤的分別出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就可以當作我的口。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必歸向你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你卻不可歸向他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使你向這百姓成為堅固的銅牆；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必攻擊你，卻不能勝你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我與你同在，要拯救你，搭救你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必搭救你脫離惡人的手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"救贖你脫離強暴人的手。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":20,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：我在這地邊界的關口","reference":{"chapter":15,"verse":7}},{"noteId":21,"caller":"-","text":"原文是手","reference":{"chapter":15,"verse":17}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}